description=Realism nutrition overhaul for Build 42 dedicated servers, 42.21 and newer. Tracks 27 nutrients beyond the four vanilla macros, re-bases 522 vanilla foods from published food-composition data, and drives hunger from stomach fullness, recent meals and the energy deficit, plus thirst, body fat and lean mass, weight, strength and deficiency and excess effects from its own body model, with caffeine, alcohol and sleep debt; shown in a panel, a food tooltip band, a character tab and optional moodles. Set the vanilla Nutrition sandbox option off. Hunger, thirst and fatigue rate tweaks have no effect in the default Managed mode. Incompatible: Nutrition Makes Sense; hunger, energy or weight model mods; fatigue writers; body-weight and metabolism mods; SomewhatTraitsCore's adaptive-metabolism trait. MoodleFramework is optional. Every update that changes a script or Lua file is a server event: update the server first. See README, CHANGELOG and COMPATIBILITY in the mod folder.
modversion=1.0.0
